From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:52:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D206 server: switching a session to an unknown agent is a 404

Upstream: POST /api/session/:id/agent with an agent that does not exist answers 204 and records it; the session's
next prompt then fails with "Agent not found".
Fixed: the route checks the agent in the session's location (after its plugins load, like /api/agent) and answers
404 AgentNotFoundError ("Agent not found: <id>"), the error /api/agent/:id already uses; nothing is recorded.
The route also declares the location errors it can now return (404 LocationNotFoundError, 503 when plugins do not
finish loading).
Scenarios: project-agents.test.ts "switching a session to a custom agent"; cli-run.test.ts "run selects the
model, variant and agent" (run --agent no-such-agent fails on the switch with the 404's message)
Upstream tests: packages/server/test/session-update.test.ts adds a test; client and openapi.json regenerated

